# Week 8 - The Price is Right (deal-hunting dashboard demo).
# This demo serves clearly-labelled SAMPLE deals and makes no external calls,
# so NO API key is required to run it.
#
# In the real Week 8 build the agent pipeline (Planning / Scanner / Ensemble
# pricer / Messaging agents) runs in Python and uses keys such as OPENAI_API_KEY,
# a Modal token for the fine-tuned pricer, and a Pushover token for notifications.
# Those live in the Python project, not here.

# Optional: port the Hono API off the default 8788
# PORT=8788
